{"id":"647410","name":"金桔蜜饯","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647410/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"金桔","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金桔洗净。","img":"images/647410/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"竖向打花刀，顶底都不切段。","img":"images/647410/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"压扁，挤出籽。","img":"images/647410/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"全部弄好。","img":"images/647410/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放些许白糖，搅匀。","img":"images/647410/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"腌制几天，白糖溶化即可。","img":"images/647410/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里放清水，放金桔和汤汁。","img":"images/647410/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放几块冰糖。","img":"images/647410/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开锅，改中小火煮至金桔变透明状。","img":"images/647410/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/647410/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒桂花。","img":"images/647410/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"凉透。","img":"images/647410/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装瓶子里。","img":"images/647410/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647410/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"我买的金桔是熟透的那种，生吃味道也足够好，所以，糖一定别放多了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}